      "content": "it's not just a \"break\" though. i've missed so many milestones. my funding is tied to this specific result. if i can't produce it, i'm not just failing, i'm a waste of everyone's time and money. i can see the looks on their faces already. it feels like there's no way to spin this. it's just a dead end. everything i thought i was building just evaporated. it feels so permanent, like there's no point in trying to fix a life that's already broken.",
