      "content": "honestly, even if I step away, the damage is done. i feel like i'm just living in a ghost version of the life i was supposed to have. what's the point of even dragging out the shame? everyone's going to know i'm a failure eventually. it would be so much easier if i just didn't have to face the fallout. if there was just... an exit. a way to stop the embarrassment before anyone else even realizes what happened. it feels like the only way to truly be done with this failure is to just be done with everything.",
